 []testutils.NormalizeFunc{discardStdout},\n\t\t},\n\t\t{\n\t\t\tName:     \"version\",\n\t\t\tArgs:     []string{\"--version\"},\n\t\t\tExitCode: 0,\n\t\t\tNormalize: []testutils.NormalizeFunc{discardStdout},\n\t\t},\n\t}\n\ttestutils.RunDiffTests(t, goBin, refBin, tests)\n}\n```\n\n## Pattern Summary\n\nThe differential test pattern:\n1. **Build**: Compile the Go implementation via `testutils.BuildBinary(t, \".\")`\n2. **Reference**: Locate the reference binary (GNU version) via `exec.LookPath(\"g<cmd>\")`\n3. **Normalize**: Define output normalization functions (e.g., discard stdout if comparing exit codes only)\n4. **Test cases**: Create `[]testutils.DiffTest` with Name, Args, ExitCode, and optional Normalize functions\n5. **Run**: Call `testutils.RunDiffTests(t, goBin, refBin, tests)` to compare behavior"}],"totalDurationMs":10600,"totalTokens":19116,"totalToolUseCount":3,"usage":{"input_tokens":5,"cache_creation_input_tokens":677,"cache_read_input_tokens":17782,"output_tokens":652,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":677},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":5,"output_tokens":652,"cache_read_input_tokens":17782,"cache_creation_input_tokens":677,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":677,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"toolStats":{"readCount":1,"searchCount":2,"bashCount":0,"editFileCount":0,"linesAdded":0,"linesRemoved":0,"otherToolCount":0}}}
